# Ignore file for Branched-Frontend/Dockerfile, whose build context is the repo root.
# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile (a Branched-Frontend/.dockerignore
# would not apply to a repo-root context). Paths are relative to the repo root.
# Send only mobile/ and Branched-Frontend/ sources: no dependencies, builds, secrets or backend data.
*
!mobile
!Branched-Frontend

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.expo
**/dist
**/web-build
**/.env*
**/.git
**/.claude
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/npm-debug.log*
Branched-Frontend/public/unsaid
Branched-Frontend/screenshots
Branched-Frontend/reference
Branched-Frontend/test-results
Branched-Frontend/playwright-report
Branched-Frontend/Dockerfile*
